    {
      "story_id": "US-001",
      "revision_id": "R1",
      "title": "beacon-v1.3.6-visual-management-console-and-material-viewer",
      "priority": "medium",
      "status": "verified",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "AC-001",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "首页生命周期优先：首页默认先展示项目数、阻塞数、活跃运行态数、重点介入区、项目清单、当前交付与下一步，不能先展示 runtime 洪流。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "verified",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260422T142730Z-2118",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260422T233856016776",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-21T14:22:53.632206+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-002",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "CEO 视图极简：首页默认不得出现 tmux pane、raw event、完整 transcript、宿主交互洪流等机器内部细节。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "verified",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260422T142730Z-2118",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260422T233856016776",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-21T14:22:53.632206+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-003",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "多项目密集管理：管理总览必须提供稳定的项目注册表，至少展示项目名、项目类型、当前版本、主 feature、当前阶段、总进度、健康态、debug 态、下一步与推荐 skill。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "verified",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260422T142730Z-2118",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260422T233856016776",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-21T14:22:53.632206+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-004",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "项目详情可接力：项目详情页必须展示版本线、主 PRD、并行 PRD、需求物料状态、当前阶段、最近交付摘要与推荐动作。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "verified",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260422T142730Z-2118",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260422T233856016776",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-21T14:22:53.632206+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-005",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "需求闭环可见：项目详情必须显式表达 `prd / user-story / test-case` 的 `missing / draft / ready / frozen` 或等价冻结状态。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "verified",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260422T142730Z-2118",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260422T233856016776",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-21T14:22:53.632206+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-006",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "Markdown 只读查看成立：管理端必须支持网页内查看版本包文档、PRD、user-story、test-case，但不得提供在线编辑能力。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "verified",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260422T142730Z-2118",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260422T233856016776",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-21T14:22:53.632206+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-007",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "文档查看按版本组织：Markdown 查看器必须可以按 `version -> document type -> feature` 浏览 Beacon 文档，并保留来源路径。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "verified",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260422T142730Z-2118",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260422T233856016776",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-21T14:22:53.632206+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-008",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "Runtime 下钻分层：首页和项目详情只展示 runtime 摘要；`single / team / ralph` 详细字段只在运行中心页展开。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "verified",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260422T142730Z-2118",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260422T233856016776",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-21T14:22:53.632206+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-009",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "Team 代理态透明：当 runtime 为 `team` 时，必须显示 agent 数、role、status、linked run、artifact 引用，以及 `Codex / Claude` session metadata 引用。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "verified",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260422T142730Z-2118",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260422T233856016776",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-21T14:22:53.632206+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-010",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "Ralph 闭环可观测：当 runtime 为 `ralph` 时，必须显示 `round_count / failure_streak / next_action / blocker / recent_result`。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "verified",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260422T142730Z-2118",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260422T233856016776",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-21T14:22:53.632206+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-011",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "Session 边界受控：管理端可以展示 `Codex / Claude` session 的有限 metadata、linked run 与 transcript ref，但不得把完整宿主会话系统并入 Beacon 真相层。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "verified",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260422T142730Z-2118",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260422T233856016776",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-21T14:22:53.632206+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-012",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "恢复诊断可解释：当 SQLite / PocketBase 缺失或投影失败时，页面必须明确 truth 仍来自 `docs/beacon` 与 `.beacon`，并展示 degraded / rebuild / doctor 提示。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "verified",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260422T142730Z-2118",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260422T233856016776",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-21T14:22:53.632206+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-013",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "产品边界稳定：默认看板只管理 Beacon 项目，不纳入 `omc / omx` 等 Beacon 外系统。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "verified",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260422T142730Z-2118",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260422T233856016776",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-21T14:22:53.632206+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-014",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "四个真实项目并板正确：`rolo / slow_uni_bmtop / shopxo_canada / beacon` 必须都可进入看板，并能解释其 `project_kind / lifecycle / debug state / next step`。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "verified",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260422T142730Z-2118",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260422T233856016776",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-21T14:22:53.632206+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-015",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "页面实现回链 freeze：项目页面的结构实现、路由关系与状态说明必须能回链到 `v1.3.5` wireframe artifact。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "verified",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260422T142730Z-2118",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260422T233856016776",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-21T14:22:53.632206+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-016",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "人类心智优先：在屏蔽机器交互细节时，管理端仍必须给出足够的人类可决策信息，不得因隐藏 runtime 细节而让项目状态不可判断。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "verified",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260422T142730Z-2118",
          "verified_by_run_id": "run-20260422T233856016776",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-21T14:22:53.632206+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:markdown"
        },
